    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "3. As per facts of the case, complainant 'NS alias B' gave his statement that he is father of two daughters and a son.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1432,
      "end": 1550,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "NS alias B",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1474,
          "end": 1484
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1797560602426529
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The victim 'JK' age about 17 years was studying in Class 12th in Government Girls Senior Secondary School, Bathinda Road, Sri Muktsar Sahib.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1551,
      "end": 1691,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Government Girls Senior Secondary School, Bathinda Road",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1616,
          "end": 1671
        },
        {
          "text": "Muktsar Sahib",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1677,
          "end": 1690
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19860094785690308
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "On 24.01.2024, she was to appear in her last examination and she had gone to the school by auto.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1692,
      "end": 1788,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "24.01.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1695,
          "end": 1705
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2632698118686676
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "After examination, she did not reach home.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1789,
      "end": 1831,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.247469961643219
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "He and his family members searched for his daughter but could not locate her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1832,
      "end": 1909,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28307563066482544
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "They came to know that after her examination, she was kidnapped by someone by giving her allurement of marriage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1910,
      "end": 2023,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2582321763038635
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "With these allegations, initially FIR was registered under Sections 363 and 366-A of IPC.\n4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2024,
      "end": 2116,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sections 363",
          "label": "PROVISION",
