        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3699,
          "end": 3706
        },
        {
          "text": "09.04.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3713,
          "end": 3723
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26909002661705017
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "At that time, present petitioner was not named.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3725,
      "end": 3772,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27847692370414734
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "Later on, complainant gave improved version and falsely nominated petitioner as accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3773,
      "end": 3861,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29450687766075134
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "Version put forward by prosecutrix is highly improbable.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3862,
      "end": 3918,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2195511758327484
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "She was travelling from one place to the other and never raised alarm nor tried to contact the police.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3919,
      "end": 4021,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3341943323612213
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "Petitioner is behind the bars since 31.03.2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4022,
      "end": 4069,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "31.03.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 4058,
          "end": 4068
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27710726857185364
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "Challan is already presented and petitioner is facing trial.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4070,
      "end": 4130,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26461082696914673
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "At present statements of material witnesses have been recorded i.e. father of victim 'NS' as PW-1 who did not name present petitioner and secondly,\nvictim herself as PW-2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4131,
      "end": 4302,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29870834946632385
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "During cross-examination, she did not identify present petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4303,
      "end": 4369,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.36944013833999634
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "Trial in this case may take long time.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4370,
      "end": 4408,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3035188317298889
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "He will abide by terms of bail order.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 4409,
      "end": 4446,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.36166343092918396
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "Therefore, his regular bail petition may be allowed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4447,
      "end": 4499,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37256482243537903
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 42,
      "text": "6. Learned counsel representing petitioner Raj Kaur wife of Balwinder Singh in CRM-M-8948-2025 argued that she is falsely 3 of 5 CRM-M-49367-2024 (O&M) and other connected case implicated in this case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4501,
      "end": 4702,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Raj Kaur",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 4544,
          "end": 4552
        },
        {
          "text": "Balwinder Singh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 4561,
          "end": 4576
        },
        {
          "text": "CRM-M-8948-2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 4580,
          "end": 4595
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1568114012479782
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 43,
      "text": "No specific role is attributed to her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4703,
      "end": 4741,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2403402477502823
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 44,
      "text": "There is long delay in lodging report to police.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4742,
      "end": 4790,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25660276412963867
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 45,
      "text": "Present Raj Kaur vs State Of Punjab on 7 November, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/161494942/\n2",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4791,
      "end": 4903,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Raj Kaur vs State Of Punjab on 7 November, 2025 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 4799,
          "end": 4860
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3348373472690582
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 46,
      "text": "petitioner is 62 years of age and is suffering from various ailments.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4904,
      "end": 4973,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2401091754436493
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 47,
      "text": "She is behind the bars since 02.04.2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4974,
      "end": 5014,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "02.04.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 5003,
          "end": 5013
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21916668117046356
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 48,
      "text": "She will abide by terms of bail order.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 5015,
      "end": 5053,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19194963574409485
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 49,
      "text": "Therefore, her regular bail petition may be allowed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 5054,
      "end": 5106,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22633737325668335
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 50,
      "text": "7. Regular bail petitions filed by petitioners are opposed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 5108,
      "end": 5167,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15111427009105682
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 51,
      "text": "Detailed status report has been filed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 5168,
      "end": 5206,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1399115025997162
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 52,
      "text": "It is pointed out that during the course of investigation, it was found that there are 10 accused persons involved in commission of offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 5207,
      "end": 5347,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16189883649349213
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 53,
      "text": "Both petitioners indulged in child trafficking.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 5348,
      "end": 5395,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2603665292263031
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 54,
      "text": "At the time of occurrence, victim was minor.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 5396,
      "end": 5440,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2024451196193695
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 55,
      "text": "Victim was sexually abused by different persons for money.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 5441,
      "end": 5499,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23332597315311432
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 56,
      "text": "Considering the gravity of offence and the manner in which it has been committed, petitioners are not entitled to be released on regular bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5500,
      "end": 5643,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2529437243938446
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 57,
      "text": "8. I have considered the arguments and have gone through the record carefully.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5645,
      "end": 5723,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09110230207443237
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 58,
      "text": "Victim got missing on 24.01.2024 and finally she was recovered on 04.04.2024 from the house of Karan Kumar alias Rakesh Kumar.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5724,
      "end": 5850,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "24.01.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 5746,
          "end": 5756
        },
        {
          "text": "04.04.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 5790,
          "end": 5800
        },
        {
          "text": "Karan Kumar alias Rakesh Kumar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 5819,
          "end": 5849
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1922968327999115
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 59,
      "text": "Her statement was recorded under Section 164 Cr.P.C.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5851,
      "end": 5903,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 164",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 5884,
          "end": 5895
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 5896,
          "end": 5903
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21553197503089905
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 60,
      "text": "She narrated the facts and named some of the accused persons how they participated in commission of offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5904,
      "end": 6012,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08939632028341293
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 61,
      "text": "She did not know them earlier.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6013,
      "end": 6043,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19186942279338837
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 62,
      "text": "Factual position clarified during investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6044,
      "end": 6092,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09951712191104889
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 63,
      "text": "Both petitioners are behind the bars.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6093,
      "end": 6130,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2043372541666031
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 64,
      "text": "Trial in this case is going on.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6131,
      "end": 6162,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17971795797348022
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 65,
      "text": "Till date statement of father of victim has been recorded as PW-1,\nwhereas, statement of victim is being recorded as PW-2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6163,
      "end": 6285,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16174481809139252
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 66,
      "text": "Her examination-in-chief was recorded partly on 18.08.2025. Remaining examination-in-chief was deferred and she was again recalled on 27.08.2025.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6286,
      "end": 6431,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "18.08.2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 6334,
          "end": 6344
        },
        {
          "text": "27.08.2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 6420,
          "end": 6430
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09569510817527771
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 67,
      "text": "On completion of her examination-in-chief, 4 of 5 CRM-M-49367-2024 (O&M) and other connected case she is facing cross-examination which is still going on.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6432,
      "end": 6586,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24398964643478394
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 68,
      "text": "When statement of victim was recorded in-chief, she did not identify one of the accused namely Deepak Kumar i.e.\npetitioner in CRM-M-49367-2024 and regarding other accused Raj Kaur, she duly identified her in examination- in-chief.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6587,
      "end": 6818,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Deepak Kumar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 6682,
          "end": 6694
        },
        {
          "text": "CRM-M-49367-2024",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 6714,
          "end": 6730
        },
        {
          "text": "Raj Kaur",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 6759,
          "end": 6767
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3990417718887329
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 69,
      "text": "Complete statement of victim has not been recorded till date.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6819,
      "end": 6880,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.43783167004585266
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 70,
      "text": "Facts as detailed by her in her statement recorded under Section 164 Cr.P.C., it is evident that minor victim was indulged in child trafficking.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6881,
      "end": 7025,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 164",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 6938,
          "end": 6949
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 6950,
          "end": 6957
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5653402805328369
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 71,
      "text": "She was being taken from one place to the other by taking huge amounts.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 7026,
      "end": 7097,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5488874912261963
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 72,
      "text": "Victim was sexually exploited by different persons.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 7098,
      "end": 7149,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4953750669956207
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 73,
      "text": "In fact, victim fell into the trap of gang operating with child trafficking.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 7150,
      "end": 7226,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5386375188827515
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 74,
      "text": "Therefore, considering the gravity of offence and manner in which it has been committed, I am not inclined to grant regular bail to both petitioners i.e. Deepak Kumar alias Deepak Rai and Raj Kaur wife of Balwinder Singh and petitions filed by them i.e.\nCRM-M-49367-2024 and CRM-M-8948-2025 are, accordingly, dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 7227,
      "end": 7546,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Deepak Kumar alias Deepak Rai",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 7381,
          "end": 7410
        },
        {
          "text": "Raj Kaur",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 7415,
          "end": 7423
        },
        {
          "text": "Balwinder Singh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 7432,
          "end": 7447
        },
        {
          "text": "CRM-M-49367-2024",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 7481,
          "end": 7497
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2811761498451233
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 75,
      "text": "9. Pending miscellaneous application(s), if any, in both cases, stand disposed of accordingly as well.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 7547,
      "end": 7650,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
